  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ishaka Maize and Potato Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to begin producing maize and processing maize flour. The funds will also be used to expand potato production of which a portion will be kept as seed for members and the rest will be sold for food.</narrative>
  </description>
